	"Description": "是自己画的马鲁的性转行走图。\n<br />包括两个行走图，一个日常，一个医院。\n<br />可自由使用。\n<br />我自己是把原版的行走图拆开之后，替换图片，然后再重新整合起来，放到游戏行走图文件夹里去替换的。\n<br />\n<br />现在更新了可以直接覆盖的便捷版本。\n<br />在&#92;SteamLibrary&#92;steamapps&#92;common&#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Content&#92;Characters 进行替换就可以了。\n<br />\n<br />Because\u00A0my\u00A0English\u00A0is\u00A0not\u00A0good,\u00A0so\u00A0all\u00A0the\u00A0following\u00A0is\u00A0machine\u00A0translation:\u00A0\n<br />it\u00A0is\u00A0my\u00A0own\u00A0drawing\u00A0of\u00A0Maru's\u00A0sex\u00A0turn\u00A0walking\u00A0diagram.\n<br />It\u00A0includes\u00A0two\u00A0walking\u00A0charts,\u00A0one\u00A0daily\u00A0and\u00A0one\u00A0hospital.\n<br />Free\u00A0to\u00A0use.\n<br />I\u00A0took\u00A0apart\u00A0the\u00A0original\u00A0walking\u00A0map,\u00A0replaced\u00A0the\u00A0picture,\u00A0and\u00A0then\u00A0re-integrated\u00A0it,\u00A0and\u00A0put\u00A0it\u00A0in\u00A0the\u00A0game\u00A0walking\u00A0map\u00A0folder\u00A0to\u00A0replace\u00A0it.\n<br />\n<br />Now updated with a convenient version that can be directly overwritten.\n<br />SteamLibrary&#92;steamapps&#92;common&#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Content&#92;Characters to replace it.",
